====== Xiaomi Mi WiFi 3C (Mi Wifi Router 3C / R3C / R3L) ======

[[https://xiaomi-mi.com/wifi-routers/xiaomi-mi-wifi-router-3c-white/|Xiaomi Mi WiFi Router 3C]] is 802.11n wireless router based on the [[https://www.mediatek.com/products/homeNetworking/mt7628k-n-a|MediaTek MT7628N]] SoC. It has three Ethernet ports and one radio (2T2R MiMo).

