Attaching 3 pins to J1 and connecting with a USB to TTL (CP2102 module) on COM4 115200bps using Putty console
From the COM 4:
<code>
1 —— VCC (3.3V) (DO NOT CONNECT!)
2 —— RX
3 —— GND
4 —— TX
</code>

Serial port works in one-way only (no input going through pin4).

